# The CA-04 conformance vectors under tests/data/fingerprint are hashed
# byte-for-byte (CA-04 section 4 hashes raw manifest bytes; a CRLF
# manifest changes the digest), so their bytes must come out of the
# checkout identically on every platform. `core.autocrlf` on Windows
# runners would otherwise rewrite them and fail
# `reference_vectors_match_the_committed_ca04_digests`.
crates/canary-project/tests/data/fingerprint/** text eol=lf

# The WASM artifacts are binary inputs: never convert or normalize them.
crates/canary-project/tests/data/fingerprint/**/*.wasm binary
